  (text "SAMPLER STROBE  S_STROBE 3.0 MHz, 50 % duty (167 / 167 ns), FPGA pins 38 (P) / 35 (N)" (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid a17a7b01-96ba-5b25-af25-1c944cf9dbdf))
  (hierarchical_label "S_STROBE_P" (shape input) (at 27.94 50.8 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid 78ba442d-4042-57e2-b3f5-efb628553f3c))
  (hierarchical_label "STRB_A" (shape output) (at 248.92 50.8 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 6d80ab9a-d7c4-52d5-8e3e-66d69801a552))
  (hierarchical_label "STRB_K" (shape output) (at 248.92 60.96 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4d8816e8-f801-5474-96dd-2dba85f52197))
  (hierarchical_label "S_STROBE_N" (shape input) (at 27.94 68.58 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid ae674b95-c042-52eb-a147-edb58fea95d0))
  (text "S_STROBE_N is not used: AC dummy load\n(47 R + 100 nF + 49.9 R) keeps the two\npin currents and edges symmetric; no DC load." (at 15.24 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5ab8068f-78b9-5a34-ab00-be99dee0828c))
  (text "TRF37D73 x2: 22 dB, OP1dB 16.5 dBm, 3.3 V 55 mA each.\nEdge 300-600 ps (FPGA) -> ~250 ps -> 133-152 ps.\nPWDN and NC pins to GND, EP: >= 5 vias to L2.\nBias tee: bead (pad on the line) -> 47 uH || 1 k\n-> own 100 nF at the cold end (bias_tee RESULT)." (at 58.42 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid f15cbfa2-720f-5d00-b5fd-d660b216e6f4))
  (text "12 dB pi pad 82 / 91 / 82 R (input shunt 0603):\nTRF #2 input ~+8.6 dBm square\n(abs. max +10 dBm)." (at 99.06 71.12 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9a35885a-0dcd-5028-8e50-e41800b6f6cf))
  (text "CLIP STUB TL401: 80 ps one-way = 13.2 mm\n50 R microstrip (6.05 ps/mm). Tap right at\nC(TRF #2 out); far end via to GND (NT401).\nPulse ~160 ps wide; trim 60 ps = 9.9 mm.\nD clamp BAT15-03W FITTED (bridge reverse\n3.27 V -> 1.9 V, phase_array RESULT)." (at 162.56 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 086618e2-f699-5835-ac26-e19e474471e9))
  (text "BALUN T401: Murata DLW21SN900HQ2L CMC\n(0805, 90 R CM @100 MHz, LCSC C97855)\nas 1:1 TL balun: line 1 = signal -> STRB_A,\nline 2 = GND -> STRB_K, rails float.\nSTRB_A/K: 17.83 mm 50 R arms (105.6 ps, as built), equal\n+/-0.1 mm, uncoupled (sim/strobe_arms RESULT:\nno second sampling instant; bias +/-1.3 V).\nStep at the bridge ~4.3-4.6 V (sim)." (at 219.71 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid f36742fd-5aeb-5a01-b02f-472e7058a4d6))
  (text "PHASE STROBE  PH_STROBE 48 MHz, 50 % duty, FPGA pins 39 (P) / 40 (N); one chain per polarity" (at 15.24 95.25 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4ffb3d20-807f-58cf-89c1-94abbc70408d))
  (hierarchical_label "PH_STROBE_P" (shape input) (at 27.94 133.35 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid a663c6f0-21e2-51fc-a9d7-cacebdbe37dd))
  (hierarchical_label "+5V1" (shape input) (at 198.12 105.41 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4b9fa08f-6806-5ea2-8729-3605e94cb8e2))
  (hierarchical_label "PSTRB_A" (shape output) (at 248.92 133.35 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f2dc20dd-6c51-5a19-8d40-10b078c349c7))
  (text "10 dB pi pad 100 / 68 / 100 R (input shunt\n0603): GVA input ~+10 dBm square\n(abs. max +13 dBm)." (at 99.06 148.59 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid fe54a375-2da3-579b-9f9e-09f13b312727))
  (text "GVA-84+ (SOT-89): 1 IN, 3 OUT+DC, 2/4 GND.\nVd 4.8-5.2 V, 108 mA; no Rbias at 5 V (datasheet\nFig. 2): pin 3 -> bead -> 2.2 uH -> 2.49 R -> +5V1 (5.40 V),\nVd 4.82-5.20 V (nom. 4.99 V at 110 mA). Pin 3 max 5.8 V.\n2.2 uH is enough: the launch stub shorts < 300 MHz.\nStep 7.2 V into 50 R (sim, nominal)." (at 129.54 148.59 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9d236f83-22f9-5912-97eb-2008c2ca9541))
  (text "LAUNCH STUB: 80 ps one-way = 13.2 mm 50 R\n(phase_array RESULT; was 45 ps), at the start of\nthe tap line; far end via to GND. Launch ~4 V peak,\n>= 2.75 V at every tap. BAT15-03W clamp DNP\n(reverse 2.95 V < BV 4 V: not needed)." (at 190.5 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid fdc8ba84-921c-5ceb-ae54-46779985b00c))
  (text "PSTRB_A: anode strobe line (positive pulse);\n0.16 mm / 72.8 R line along the 16 gates, 40 ps/tap\nloaded, 4.514 mm pitch; ends in 50 R on trigger_phase." (at 254 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid fb309a68-d37e-506c-949d-bfd2f33941b3))
  (hierarchical_label "PH_STROBE_N" (shape input) (at 27.94 209.55 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid 80051417-333d-5fe3-ac86-1ee28d3b2765))
  (hierarchical_label "+5V1" (shape input) (at 198.12 181.61 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 505d2e98-c1c2-59e8-b8ec-2445389a651f))
  (hierarchical_label "PSTRB_K" (shape output) (at 248.92 209.55 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 3d1733d7-bf3e-5467-ada8-7e762324a89e))
  (text "PSTRB_K: cathode strobe line (negative pulse,\nchain from the complementary pin N)." (at 254 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 60c128f6-1179-592b-b7fe-591bf52f46a6))
  (text "Both phase chains: identical layout, mirror-symmetric;\nlaunch points side by side, chain lengths matched\nto +/-0.2 mm (+/-1.2 ps) from FPGA pin to launch." (at 129.54 224.79 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid b18fc78f-08d8-5a67-8de2-b13c89c55bba))
  (text "LAYOUT / NOTES\n- All RF nets 50 R microstrip on L1 (0.36 mm, outer prepreg 7628 0.21 mm, L2 solid GND):\n  6.057 ps/mm. Gain blocks 0402 DC blocks inline, no stubs, GND vias at every shunt part.\n- Decoupling per supply node: 1 nF 0402 nearest the pin, then 100 nF, 10 uF.\n- Bias tees (sim/bias_tee): bead pad ON the 50 R line (no stub), chain perpendicular, compact;\n  TRF: 47 uH || 1 k + own 100 nF at the cold pad; supply enters through that cap.\n- Test points TRFx/GVAx: DC bias check only (expect ~3.2 V / ~4.8 V), not RF.\n- Supplies: +3V3 4 x TRF37D73 here (220 mA); +5V1 2 x GVA-84+ (216 mA), own track from the\n  TPS63802 output caps C610/C611 (power sheet), not through FB602.\n- Open: large-signal edge of both blocks in saturation, CMC differential\n  bandwidth, reverse pulse (second edge) vs BAT15 BV: measure one chain early." (at 294.64 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid ab35eea5-e67c-56b4-a736-d439ea311ca4))
